      "content": "the doctor/therapist thing doesnt help. they just give me pills that make me drowsy but i still cant sleep cause i have to wake up every time the machine beeps or he moves. it feels like im just wasting my life away in this room. there is no version of this where i get to breathe again. i just want it to be quiet. i just want to sleep and never wake up tbh.",
